[10:47] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'opening and then to the outside where it\'ll get plugged into the beginning of the run. This 3D printed box is designed to perfectly house the controller and power supply brick, and you\'re able to run the extra wires through the top and bottom slots. And I won\'t be screwing'

