[11:24] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the wire to the beginning of the lights. And then we can use the same clear clips that we did in the front to secure the core to the side of the house. If you wanted this run to disappear, you would then paint it the same color as the siding. And once I have my security camera wires fed through, again, you\'ll'

[11:37] [scene:talk]
